    "description": {
      "value": "You grew up among the southern houses of Brevoy in old Rostland. You're accustomed to arguing from a position of underappreciated worth.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Politics Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Group Impression skill feat."
